2. MolmoAct2 (https://github.com/allenai/molmoact2), Allen Institute for AI (Ai2)
   Used as a dependency at a pinned commit (not vendored): the `sim_eval` harness and its `bimanual_yam` ManiSkill
   agent, the YAM policy server, and the training code under `experiments/`. Files in this repository that import or
   wrap it: eval/host_server_yam_noclip.py (imports and patches examples/yam/host_server_yam.py at runtime),
   eval/run_eval_*.py (wrap sim_eval.run_eval), train/yam_ft/train_yam_ft.py (wraps launch_scripts/train_lerobot.py).
   Our one source patch to that checkout is in patches/molmoact2/.
   The model weights MolmoAct2-BimanualYAM (https://huggingface.co/allenai/MolmoAct2-BimanualYAM), from which the
   released fine-tuned weights are derived, are licensed under Apache-2.0 per the MolmoAct2 repository README, for
   research and educational use in accordance with Ai2's Responsible Use Guidelines; the base models are Molmo2
   (Apache-2.0), built on Qwen3 (Apache-2.0) and SigLIP.
   License: Apache License 2.0

3. Ai2 real-robot YAM datasets (https://huggingface.co/allenai, 16 bimanual YAM LeRobot datasets)
   Used: as co-training data (referenced by repository id, not redistributed), and six camera frames of
   allenai/01122025-box-01 in envs/visual/real_ref/ as calibration targets for the simulated look.
   License: Apache License 2.0 (as stated on the dataset pages)

4. ManiSkill 3 (https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill), Hillbot Inc. and UCSD SU Lab
